THE ENERGY MODEL'S DESIGN CASES WITH THE CHOSEN ARRAY'S PERFORMANCE RATIO, AND THE PLANES (energy_runs.py, stream a1solar,
MESHSAT-1357, second issue). PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing built, ordered or measured. Reference-day MODEL results (September at
Leiden, PVGIS mean days), AI arithmetic, not a qualified review. Both scripts imported unchanged (sha256 pinned).

0. REPRODUCTION OF THE PUBLISHED FIGURES WITH THE PINNED RATIO 0.9417
   energy_architecture 4S18P 400 Wp 200 W +20 C MEETS 91.0 Wh                     reproduced
   energy_architecture +15 C MEETS 26.8 Wh                                        reproduced
   energy_two_pack design case MEETS, both 31.1 Wh                                reproduced
   the 40/0 anchor scaled by 1.007820 reproduces the model's September profile    reproduced

