5. THE ARRAY AND THE TWO-PACK CASE'S LID TEMPERATURE THRESHOLD (E2, 200 W, ratio of case B)
   with the pinned ratio at 400 Wp the lid meets down to +9.6 C
    400 Wp: MEETS at the basis; lid meets down to +9.6 C
    450 Wp: MEETS at the basis; lid meets down to +9.1 C
